const HTML="<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#f3f0ed\"><title>镜间造型室 · MIRROR ATELIER</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/app.css\"></head><body>\n<header><a class=\"brand\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"brand-mark\">m.</span><span>镜间造型室<small>MIRROR ATELIER</small></span></a><nav><button class=\"active\" id=\"studioTab\">造型工作室</button><button id=\"collectionTab\">我的造型 <span id=\"savedCount\">0</span></button></nav><div class=\"header-right\"><button id=\"help\" class=\"icon\" aria-label=\"使用说明\">?</button><span class=\"avatar\">Y</span></div></header>\n<main id=\"studio\"><aside class=\"rail\" aria-label=\"素材类别\"></aside><section class=\"stage\"><div class=\"stage-top\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">YOUR NEXT LOOK</span><h1>今天，成为新的自己。</h1><p>一点灵感，无限可能。选一套属于你的造型。</p></div><button class=\"quiet\" id=\"random\">✧ 灵感随机搭</button></div><div class=\"mirror-area\"><div class=\"mirror-label\"><span>人物预览</span><span id=\"previewMode\">原始人像</span></div><div class=\"mirror\"><img id=\"hero\" alt=\"当前人像参考\"><div class=\"empty-hero\" hidden>选择一位人物<br><small>或上传你的照片</small></div><div class=\"mirror-glow\"></div><div id=\"busy\" hidden><div class=\"spinner\"></div><h3>正在为你打造新造型</h3><p>人像、衣装与灵感，正在慢慢相遇。</p><span id=\"elapsed\">0 秒</span><button id=\"cancel\">停止等待</button></div></div><div class=\"stage-tools\"><button id=\"compare\" disabled>◫ 按住对比</button><button id=\"download\" disabled>↓ 下载成片</button><button id=\"fullscreen\">⛶ 大图</button></div><div id=\"referenceStrip\"></div><div class=\"stage-caption\"><span class=\"tiny-line\"></span><span id=\"stageCaption\">搭配参考会展示在下方，生成后查看完整造型</span><span class=\"tiny-line\"></span></div></div><div class=\"selection-bar\"><div class=\"selection-heading\"><b>这次的灵感</b><button id=\"reset\">重置搭配</button></div><div id=\"slots\"></div><div class=\"generate-row\"><button id=\"saveLook\" class=\"secondary\">保存搭配</button><button id=\"generate\" class=\"primary\">✧ 生成我的造型</button></div><p id=\"serviceStatus\" role=\"status\">正在检查生成服务…</p></div></section><section class=\"wardrobe\"><div class=\"wardrobe-heading\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">THE EDIT</span><h2 id=\"categoryTitle\">服装</h2></div><span id=\"categoryCount\" class=\"count\"></span></div><div class=\"search\"><span>⌕</span><input id=\"search\" placeholder=\"搜索款式、颜色、关键词…\" aria-label=\"搜索素材\"><button id=\"clearSearch\" aria-label=\"清空搜索\">×</button></div><div class=\"library-toolbar\"><select id=\"filter\" aria-label=\"筛选分类\"></select><button id=\"favorites\" aria-pressed=\"false\">♡ 收藏</button><button id=\"adult\" aria-pressed=\"false\">18+</button></div><div id=\"makeup\" hidden><div class=\"makeup-intro\"><h3>妆容，是最后一笔灵感。</h3><p>选择妆面与唇色，随人物、衣装一起生成。</p></div><div id=\"makeupPresets\"></div><h3 class=\"section-title\">唇色</h3><div id=\"swatches\"></div><label class=\"range-label\">妆容浓度 <span id=\"strengthLabel\">45%</span><input type=\"range\" id=\"strength\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"45\"></label><h3 class=\"section-title\">画面风格</h3><div id=\"styles\"></div><h3 class=\"section-title\">画幅</h3><select id=\"ratio\"><option value=\"1024x1536\">竖幅 2:3</option><option value=\"1024x1024\">方形 1:1</option><option value=\"1536x1024\">横幅 3:2</option></select><label class=\"section-title\" for=\"extra\">补充灵感</label><textarea id=\"extra\" maxlength=\"1000\" placeholder=\"例如：日落光线，淡淡雀斑，保留自然肤质…\"></textarea></div><label class=\"upload\" id=\"uploadLabel\" hidden>＋ 上传我的照片<input id=\"upload\" type=\"file\" accept=\"image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp\" hidden></label><div id=\"grid\" class=\"grid\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div id=\"empty\" hidden><h3>还没有找到这份灵感</h3><p>试试其他关键词，或清空筛选。</p><button id=\"clearFilters\">清空筛选</button></div><button id=\"more\" class=\"more\" hidden>加载更多</button><footer><span>素材来自 PoseWear · 保留原图来源</span><button id=\"credits\">素材说明</button></footer></section></main>\n<section id=\"collection\" hidden><div class=\"collection-title\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">YOUR LOOKBOOK</span><h1>我的造型簿</h1><p>留住灵感，下一次接着创作。内容保存在当前浏览器。</p></div><div id=\"looks\"></div></section>\n<dialog id=\"detail\"><button class=\"close\" aria-label=\"关闭\">×</button><div id=\"detailContent\"></div></dialog><dialog id=\"info\"><button class=\"close\" aria-label=\"关闭\">×</button><div id=\"infoContent\"></div></dialog><div id=\"toast\" role=\"status\"></div><script src=\"/app.js\" defer></script></body></html>\n";
